16.105.m:
for the sake of consecrating the liṅga in the auspicious sacred field of Prabhāsa;
together with a crore of brahmin seers and accompanied by Viśvakarman,
he had the excellent liṅga consecrated according to the injunctions.

Twice that should be known as a nimiṣa, O fair-faced one;
fifteen nimiṣas are called a kāṣṭhā by the wise;
and thirty kāṣṭhās are declared to be a kalā by the intelligent.
